{"id": "code-004", "bucket": "code", "prompt": "Напиши функцію Python max_of_list(lst), що повертає найбільший елемент списку без вбудованої функції max(). Тільки код.", "reference": "def max_of_list(lst):\n    result = lst[0]\n    for x in lst[1:]:\n        if x > result:\n            result = x\n    return result", "notes": "", "system": "mamay12", "model_requested": "mamay12", "router": {"model": "mamay12", "intent": "fixed", "reason": "always mamay12", "backend_model": "INSAIT-Institute/MamayLM-Gemma-3-12B-IT-v2.0", "api_base": "http://127.0.0.1:8002/v1"}, "vram_snapshot_mb": [{"index": 0, "name": "NVIDIA RTX 6000 Ada Generation", "memory_used_mb": 42248.0, "memory_total_mb": 49140.0}, {"index": 1, "name": "NVIDIA RTX 6000 Ada Generation", "memory_used_mb": 17966.0, "memory_total_mb": 49140.0}, {"index": 2, "name": "NVIDIA RTX 6000 Ada Generation", "memory_used_mb": 15358.0, "memory_total_mb": 49140.0}, {"index": 3, "name": "NVIDIA RTX 6000 Ada Generation", "memory_used_mb": 2.0, "memory_total_mb": 49140.0}], "http_status": 200, "latency_ms": 3978.5, "content": "```python\ndef max_of_list(lst):\n    if not lst:\n        return None\n    max_val = lst[0]\n    for num in lst:\n        if num > max_val:\n            max_val = num\n    return max_val\n```", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 45, "total_tokens": 109, "completion_tokens": 64, "prompt_tokens_details": null}, "error": null}
{"id": "code-005", "bucket": "code", "prompt": "Напиши функцію Python count_vowels(s), що рахує голосні літери (a,e,i,o,u) у рядку. Тільки код.", "reference": "def count_vowels(s):\n    return sum(1 for c in s.lower() if c in 'aeiou')", "notes": "", "system": "mamay12", "model_requested": "mamay12", "router": {"model": "mamay12", "intent": "fixed", "reason": "always mamay12", "backend_model": "INSAIT-Institute/MamayLM-Gemma-3-12B-IT-v2.0", "api_base": "http://127.0.0.1:8002/v1"}, "vram_snapshot_mb": [{"index": 0, "name": "NVIDIA RTX 6000 Ada Generation", "memory_used_mb": 42248.0, "memory_total_mb": 49140.0}, {"index": 1, "name": "NVIDIA RTX 6000 Ada Generation", "memory_used_mb": 17966.0, "memory_total_mb": 49140.0}, {"index": 2, "name": "NVIDIA RTX 6000 Ada Generation", "memory_used_mb": 15358.0, "memory_total_mb": 49140.0}, {"index": 3, "name": "NVIDIA RTX 6000 Ada Generation", "memory_used_mb": 2.0, "memory_total_mb": 49140.0}], "http_status": 200, "latency_ms": 3487.1, "content": "```python\ndef count_vowels(s):\n    count = 0\n    vowels = \"aeiouAEIOU\"\n    for char in s:\n        if char in vowels:\n            count += 1\n    return count\n```", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 48, "total_tokens": 104, "completion_tokens": 56, "prompt_tokens_details": null}, "error": null}
{"id": "code-006", "bucket": "code", "prompt": "Напиши функцію Python fibonacci(n), що повертає n-те число Фібоначчі (0-індексація). Тільки код.", "reference": "def fibonacci(n):\n    a, b = 0, 1\n    for _ in range(n):\n        a, b = b, a + b\n    return a", "notes": "", "system": "mamay12", "model_requested": "mamay12", "router": {"model": "mamay12", "intent": "fixed", "reason": "always mamay12", "backend_model": "INSAIT-Institute/MamayLM-Gemma-3-12B-IT-v2.0", "api_base": "http://127.0.0.1:8002/v1"}, "vram_snapshot_mb": [{"index": 0, "name": "NVIDIA RTX 6000 Ada Generation", "memory_used_mb": 42248.0, "memory_total_mb": 49140.0}, {"index": 1, "name": "NVIDIA RTX 6000 Ada Generation", "memory_used_mb": 17966.0, "memory_total_mb": 49140.0}, {"index": 2, "name": "NVIDIA RTX 6000 Ada Generation", "memory_used_mb": 15358.0, "memory_total_mb": 49140.0}, {"index": 3, "name": "NVIDIA RTX 6000 Ada Generation", "memory_used_mb": 2.0, "memory_total_mb": 49140.0}], "http_status": 200, "latency_ms": 4216.3, "content": "```python\ndef fibonacci(n):\n    if n <= 1:\n        return n\n    else:\n        a, b = 0, 1\n        for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n            a, b = b, a + b\n        return b\n```", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 45, "total_tokens": 113, "completion_tokens": 68, "prompt_tokens_details": null}, "error": null}
